 .github/workflows/integration-critical-ci.yml | 11 +----
 .github/workflows/packing-ci-canary.yml       | 12 ++++-
 Erdos302.lean                                 |  1 -
 Erdos302/Axioms.lean                          | 44 +++++--------------
 4 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

